  "abstract": "A growing collection of model-generated Lean formalizations and reconstructions of Gary L. Peterson’s research. The first two papers are The Essential Dekker’s Algorithm and Peterson–Fischer’s Economical Solutions for the Critical Section Problem in a Distributed System. Source-specific guides explain checked results, counterexamples, assumptions and unestablished claims.",
